WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:48.880
Someone once said:

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:52.050
On a springtime, grassy plain

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:56.120
grow horsetails the flavor 
of all kinds of shumai...

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:59.660
Horsetail Shumai!

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:06.530
A horse made of delicious macarons...

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:09.370
Delicious, insteed!

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:12.770
The Marecaron!

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:15.640
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:21.180
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:26.750
White Hot! Toriko vs. the IGO President!

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:34.460
Yum!

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:37.700
The Century Soup!

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:41.130
No matter how many times I have it, 
the taste never fails to satisfy!

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:43.770
It's so delicious, I can't stop grinning!

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.740
Thank you very much.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:50.710
But man, look at all the happy customers!

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:51.640
Yes...

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:56.650
Everyone came to enjoy the Century 
Soup, and they all love it!

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:59.190
It makes me so happy, too!

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:02.550
No, it's not just the Century Soup.

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:09.360
The customers are pleased 
by every dish you cook.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:16.030
This Surprise Scallop sauté 
and this Oyster Cheese pasta...

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:18.770
All your dishes are the best!

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:21.140
Have your cooking skills improved, Komatsu?

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:22.910
Y-You think?

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:25.640
Well, if they have, it's all 
thanks to you, Toriko-san!

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:27.480
It's because of my travels with you,

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:29.410
and all the ingredients I've encountered...

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:30.550
Yum!

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:32.580
He's not even listening!

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:34.250
Huh? Did you say something?

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:36.350
No, never mind.

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:38.020
Oh, right!

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:40.390
You came to pick this up...

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:42.430
Yeah, right.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:45.460
I was so caught up in the 
meal, I almost forgot.

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:47.060
My pleasure!

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:48.670
This is...

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:49.530
Yes.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:51.040
It's Rainbow Fruit wine.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.810
I asked a top-class wine craftsman...

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:56.810
I guarantee the taste!

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:58.340
Thanks!

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.280
This'll be a perfect gift!

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:02.450
You're giving it to someone?

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:05.920
Anyway... There's another 
bottle for me, right?

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:09.020
Yes! I prepared two, just like you asked.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:13.020
Well then, let's crack open a bottle!

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:19.130
He opened it!

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:24.830
A super-high-grade wine made from the 
500 million yen a piece Rainbow Fruit...

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:27.600
I wonder what kind of 
person he's giving it to?

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:37.650
Head Chef!

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:40.880
The Boss is awaiting his meal.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.150
Again?

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:45.350
I have no time to eat myself!

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:46.790
In any case, Alfaro,

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:51.390
it seems the Boss's bottomless 
appetite has gotten even worse...

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:53.260
Honestly...

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:58.070
Even after adding three Vice-Chefs...

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:01.370
Tommy is healing from his wounds now...

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:04.440
The increase in the Boss's appetite

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:07.440
is surely a sign that GOD 
will appear soon, yes?

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:11.980
Our final goal is, ultimately, GOD.

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:13.410
Do not forget that.

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:17.550
The Boss was not satisfied 
by the Century Soup.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:22.320
Is the only ingredient that can 
satisfy his hunger now GOD?

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:23.890
Or perhaps...

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.840
Well, well... Toriko-sama!

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:44.580
Hey, Morton! You look well.

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:46.310
Is old man Ichiryu in?

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:50.380
Oh, President Ichiryu has 
been waiting for you!

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:51.550
Now then, come with me.

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:57.520
That's a delicious-looking fish you've 
got swimming in this holding tank!

00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:59.360
It's not for eating!

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:02.130
It's one of only four left in 
the world. An Energy Arowana!

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:03.660
It's for display!

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:06.230
Oh... Not for eating?

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:10.740
Now then, the President 
awaits you on the terrace.

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:19.680
President, Toriko-sama is here to see you.

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:22.710
Here. Rainbow Fruit wine.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:27.390
It's sweet, fruity wine with 
enjoyable changing flavors.

00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:30.960
Although it's about 85% alcohol!

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:35.030
So, maybe you think it's a bit 
too "plain" a gift, old man?

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:44.940
Too plain? It's a legendary fruit 
with crazy alcohol content...

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:45.870
IGO President Ichiryu

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:46.000
That's over-the-top!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.970
What's over-the-top is 
how you look, old man...

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:52.240
Please, take your time.

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:57.920
They're mayonnaise-flavored Squidmayo squids.

00:06:57.920 --> 00:06:59.980
Spicy cod roe mayo, mustard mayo...

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:04.260
Each time you chew, the flavor changes, 
and a veil of flavor is removed...

00:07:04.260 --> 00:07:08.330
It's similar to a matryoshka doll!

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:09.990
I give thanks for this food!

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:14.500
These'll be a perfect snack to go with 
the seven-flavored Rainbow Fruit wine.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:20.770
It's already changed from a spicy cod roe 
mayo flavor to a mustard mayo flavor!

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:24.270
Now it's shrimp-flavored mayonnaise! 
Even though it's a squid!

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.310
Like it?

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:28.340
Then why don't we split 
this Rainbow Fruit wine?

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:33.480
I've heard about your activities, Toriko.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:35.250
Hey, take out the cork!

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:37.790
I can't pay attention to the 
conversation with it like that!

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:40.990
Is your forehead a champagne bottle?!

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:45.030
Sounds like you've captured a 
great deal of ingredients, Toriko.

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:49.630
Rainbow Fruit, Piggy Whale, Wonder 
Meat, G1 Corn, Emerald Soup...

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:51.300
That's wrong!

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:53.370
Everything except for the 
Rainbow Fruit is wrong!

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:56.870
Hearing about your accomplishments 
makes me so happy...

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:01.710
I'm chugging down this wine!

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:04.110
Whoa, this packs a punch!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.650
You can't take a drink?!

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:09.050
So, why'd you call for me?

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:12.490
Is there some ingredient 
you want me to capture?

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:15.960
You've grown up, Toriko.

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:20.430
And yet, I don't think there's any 
ingredient I want that you could capture.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.700
Go ahead and try me.

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:26.670
I've eaten some good stuff 
and gotten a lot stronger.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:33.410
So what do you want right now, old man?

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:37.450
Let me see...

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:42.580
GOD, I suppose?

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.630
You're also after... GOD?

00:08:57.630 --> 00:09:00.130
No, never mind. Forget what I just said.

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:01.530
That means...

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:02.640
Forget it!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:07.340
Then the information that GOD will 
appear in a few years is true!

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:18.380
You know of Acacia, yes?

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:20.390
Huh? Of course!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.120
The Gourmet God, Acacia...

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.390
He's the legendary Gourmet Hunter

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:27.590
who is said to have found GOD 
hundreds of years ago, yes?

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:31.060
Acacia, see...

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:33.630
At the end of his life, 
he took on three disciples

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:37.200
in order to pass his knowledge of 
food on to the next generation.

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:40.710
One of those disciples... is me.

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:45.680
And, the second is Knocking Master Jiro.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:50.280
The third is the current 
Boss of the Gourmet Corp.

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:54.150
Knocking Master Jiro and the 
Boss of the Gourmet Corp.?

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:57.120
Wait... How old are you, old man?

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:00.960
Don't speak with your mouth full of squid!

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:03.030
President, Toriko-sama...

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:05.660
Here is a spread of cheese.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:09.970
Mozzericle Cheese, Blazembert 
Cheese, and Cherry Cheese?

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:13.340
They all look like they'd go with wine.

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:16.370
You hardly ever drink, so how would you know?

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:17.210
Let's see...

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.650
Master Acacia, see...

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:32.520
He passed on to us the world's ingredients 
without a single omission...

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.090
Old man...

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:43.830
But he never taught us a thing about GOD, 
the ingredient of his own Full Course.

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:49.010
Acacia knew...

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:52.010
He knew that GOD, the ingredient 
that stopped the world war,

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:56.150
could also become the reason 
for war to start again.

00:10:57.350 --> 00:11:01.280
Even if everyone who knew the 
taste of GOD disappeared,

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:06.090
there was no way the legend would 
disappear from people's memories.

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:09.190
You mean people will fight over GOD?

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:12.130
It's already begun!

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:18.270
If you're after GOD, then you've 
already joined the fight.

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:21.600
But, we must prevent a war.

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:26.170
I believe that is the 
final and greatest mission

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:31.350
in this Gourmet Age for 
me, Acacia's disciple.

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:33.110
Final?

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:35.250
The reason I called you here today

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:40.390
was to see your face one last time before 
it's time for this final, big job.

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:42.760
Old man...

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:45.360
Those eyes...

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:50.460
Your body might've grown, but you haven't 
changed a bit since you were a kid.

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:53.300
Coco, Sunny, and Zebra...

00:11:53.300 --> 00:11:57.070
I remember all their faces. 
Brings back the memories...

00:11:57.340 --> 00:12:02.040
The next Gourmet Age will 
be yours to take care of!

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:10.120
Man, this isn't like you, old man.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.350
You were once on top of the Gourmet World.

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:14.790
Has retired life made you go soft?

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:21.060
We'll take care of this 
great age we've got now!

00:12:21.060 --> 00:12:25.670
If finding GOD is your mission, 
then I'll take it on!

00:12:25.670 --> 00:12:27.330
You just sit back and relax!

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:35.110
You trying to make me laugh, Toriko?

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:38.710
Who you callin' the one 
who <i>used</i> to be on top?

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:41.810
You, who doesn't even know the Gourmet World?

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:45.450
I'm not retired at all.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.890
I'm just on vacation.

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:51.620
Don't mistake me for that drunkard Jiro!

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:56.500
So... Would you show me what 
you've got, after all this time?

00:12:56.500 --> 00:13:01.230
If you talk that big, then you'd 
better be a whole lot stronger!

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:04.440
Oh, you'll fight me, old man?

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:06.710
I ain't gonna hold back!

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:11.810
Come at me like you want to 
take my life, Toriko-chan.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:16.210
Leave GOD to me. Stay out of this, old man!

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:39.200
Hey, how far are you gonna go?!

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:41.040
Pretty far!

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.870
Can't have my house busted up, can I?

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:46.540
Hey! Don't go bouncing around by yourself!

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:48.710
And don't skip over the top of the water!

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:54.380
This floating island is 
just about the right size.

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:57.920
You're slow, Toriko!

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:01.220
You're too fast, old man!

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:04.530
Running on the water like some gecko...

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:06.500
Want me to teach you how?

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:07.760
Don't bother!

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.340
It'll just take time!

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:16.270
I don't wanna waste a second of this fun!

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:19.980
Well, good then.

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:27.580
Look, Toriko! Remember this?

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:29.120
Wanna swat it?

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:30.550
Come on... Come on...

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:33.160
You're totally looking down on me...

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:37.630
I'm gonna go all-out for a change.

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:40.930
It's full-throttle right 
from the start, old man!

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:05.890
Flying Knife!

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:22.100
Throwing your Knife? Not bad.

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:27.440
Flying...

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:31.750
...Fork!

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.660
Firing a giant Fork?

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:49.100
Yeah, I'm surprised, too!

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:57.240
Looks like my revived 
left arm has powered up!

00:15:57.240 --> 00:16:01.110
13-Fold...

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:05.480
...Spiked Punch!

00:16:28.270 --> 00:16:31.040
Hmph! Your Spiked Punch...

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.700
You can fire it 13 times in a row now?

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:39.540
Act a little hurt, jeez!

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:41.610
What? From that?

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:47.790
Oh? Looks like a 13-Fold Spiked 
Punch takes a big toll on you.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:52.660
Seems you can't use that left arm you're 
so proud of for a while, Toriko.

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:56.890
Then how about this?

00:16:56.890 --> 00:17:00.430
It's hard to aim and it takes 
a big toll on my legs...

00:17:00.430 --> 00:17:02.900
...but it's plenty powerful!

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:04.430
Leg...

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:07.670
...Fork!

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:24.390
Throwing a Fork with your leg?

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.060
What a surprise!

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:30.890
Leg...

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:34.830
...Knife!

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:54.680
That's not all!

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:57.690
Single Point Concentration...

00:17:57.690 --> 00:18:04.690
13-Fold Icepick Spiked Punch!

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:12.630
You've really grown, Toriko.

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:30.020
You really have grown up well.

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:33.350
As a reward, I will teach you 
how to skip over the water.

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:57.340
So, Toriko?

00:18:57.340 --> 00:19:00.010
How did skipping over the water feel?

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:04.920
I still can't beat you?

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:08.790
No, no... You've gotten quite 
a lot stronger, Toriko.

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.420
I'm so happy!

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:15.430
I basically tried every technique I've got!

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:20.070
Can I... Can I make it in the Gourmet World?

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:25.800
I won't say you lack the 
power or the techniques...

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:27.040
Really?!

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:32.110
But, you can't clear the 
Gourmet World with just that.

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:37.620
Your enemy in the Gourmet World is 
not just giant, violent beasts...

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:39.450
It's extreme climate and 
weather conditions...

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:43.920
If you can't withstand them, you'll 
never stay alive in the Gourmet World.

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:49.790
Toriko. Did your breath 
turn white in Ice Hell?

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.660
Hey, come on... It's a continent of ice!

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:56.670
So yeah, it was cold, and 
my breath turned white.

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:58.700
Ah, not a chance then.

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:00.170
No way, no how.

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:02.210
Huh? Why?

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:05.180
Isn't it normal to have your 
breath turn white when it's cold?

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:11.850
Toriko. If you want to go to the Gourmet 
World, you need to train your body...

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:14.750
No, you need to make your cells themselves

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:17.850
adapt instantly to all kinds of environments!

00:20:19.390 --> 00:20:23.060
Well, okay... But how do I do that?

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:24.860
Oh, about that.

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:27.830
Toriko, I've got a job to request of you.

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:30.230
What? A job?

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:33.000
Yes. It'll also be training.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:37.010
Training? What ingredient 
do you want me to capture?

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:40.940
It's a really delicious ingredient!

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:42.980
A grass that blooms in the sky!

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:44.410
Ozone Grass!

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:45.780
Ozone Grass?

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:50.150
Yes. Because one bite is said to 
bring you straight up to heaven,

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:52.520
it's also called the Heavenly Grass!

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:54.560
Heavenly Grass, huh?

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:57.830
How about it for your Full Course's Salad?

00:20:57.830 --> 00:21:00.430
Heh... Ozone Grass...

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:08.000
Nice! I want to try eating it!

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:20.080
Sabrina

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:23.320
Pa-pa-pa-para

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:25.150
Sabrina

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:34.260
Rainy day, danced down on the night city

00:21:34.260 --> 00:21:41.140
You had deep red lipstick on you

00:21:41.140 --> 00:21:44.910
Like you were toyed with

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:48.340
Like you were tasted

00:21:48.340 --> 00:21:55.450
A solitary silhouette seen through the glass

00:21:55.450 --> 00:22:02.190
One day, one day... Search for true love

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:09.260
Even if hurt by the lies going around town

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:14.030
Rottening fruit

00:22:14.030 --> 00:22:15.570
Sabrina

00:22:19.540 --> 00:22:21.910
Gourmet News!

00:22:22.370 --> 00:22:24.240
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:26.810
The super-high-grade Rainbow Fruit wine!

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:30.780
I'm going to show you a snack that goes 
perfectly with such a top-level drink!

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:33.050
By combining salted, fermented 
squid with cheese,

00:22:33.050 --> 00:22:34.450
you create a heaping helping of an illusion!

00:22:34.450 --> 00:22:38.060
Incredibly, it tastes like that 
high-level ingredient, caviar!

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:44.700
This really does taste like caviar!

00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:47.130
Everyone, ink about trying it yourself!

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:48.470
Ink about it!

00:22:48.730 --> 00:22:51.900
What? You're startin' 
to get fed up with puns?

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:54.210
Then, here!

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:56.810
Caviar is sturgeon eggs!

00:22:56.810 --> 00:22:59.240
Which the Sturgeon General 
says is kind of fishy...

00:22:59.240 --> 00:23:00.810
Yeah, I know...

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:02.810
Let's move on...

00:23:02.810 --> 00:23:05.080
On to the next story!

00:23:07.200 --> 00:23:09.650
We're headed towards an altitude of 20,000 meters!

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:11.890
There are vegetables growing above the clouds!?

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:14.090
Onward to the Ozone Grass!

00:23:14.590 --> 00:23:17.130
Vegetable Garden in the Heavens! Vegetable Sky!

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:19.260
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
